{"title": "Scenting Blood", "pageid": 26649, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Scenting_Blood", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Blood.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/38/Generic_Blood.webp/300px-Generic_Blood.webp, /w/images/3/38/Generic_Blood.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/38/Generic_Blood.webp/300px-Generic_Blood.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/38/Generic_Blood.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Scenting Blood</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Sahuagin\" title=\"Sahuagin\">Sahuagin</a> passive feature. This ability triggers the sahuagin to become Blood Frenzied when it sees blood.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>If the sahuagin sees a wounded creature, it becomes <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blood-scent_Frenzy_(Condition)\" title=\"Blood-scent Frenzy (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blood Frenzied\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blood-scent_Frenzy_(Condition)\" title=\"Blood-scent Frenzy (Condition)\">Blood Frenzied</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Champion_of_Mahkloompah\" title=\"Champion of Mahkloompah\">Champion of Mahkloompah</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Devotee_of_Mahkloompah\" title=\"Devotee of Mahkloompah\">Devotee of Mahkloompah</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Sahuagin\" title=\"Sahuagin\">Sahuagin</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Sahuagin_Champion\" title=\"Sahuagin Champion\">Sahuagin Champion</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Sahuagin_Hunter\" title=\"Sahuagin Hunter\">Sahuagin Hunter</a></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715165156\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.029 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.034 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 704/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 3790/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1796/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 20/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 490/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.003/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 643708/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   31.035      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   31.035      1 -total\n 44.21%   13.719      1 Template:Cond\n 29.07%    9.022      1 Template:Condition_inline/format\n 27.83%    8.636      1 Template:Icon_link\n 26.78%    8.312      1 Template:Icon_text\n 23.51%    7.296      2 Template:Trim\n 20.67%    6.415      1 Template:Ifempty\n 14.24%    4.419      1 Template:PageSeo